WEBVTT

00:00:00.510 --> 00:00:01.800
Come here quickly!

00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:03.020
Come here immediately!

00:00:03.020 --> 00:00:04.720
Let the three of us play 'til we drop!

00:00:14.420 --> 00:00:17.020
Say bye-bye to the teacher after class!

00:00:17.020 --> 00:00:19.530
And bring back your gym clothes!

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:24.400
Wanna gather at the schoolyard to play?

00:00:24.430 --> 00:00:27.160
Aren't you gonna give a good excuse?

00:00:27.170 --> 00:00:29.710
Just leave that homework alone!

00:00:29.710 --> 00:00:34.700
Let's swing around the metal bars instead!

00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:39.770
That red backpack sure is strong

00:00:39.770 --> 00:00:42.350
One, two, line up in threes!

00:00:42.350 --> 00:00:44.880
And dash forward with the pencil case after school!

00:00:44.880 --> 00:00:49.950
You'll forget about it, so cheer up!

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:49.950
One

00:00:49.650 --> 00:00:49.950
Two!

00:00:49.950 --> 00:00:52.470
Hey Mr.! Turn around that corner!

00:00:52.470 --> 00:00:56.760
Let's have a large assembly in the schoolyard!

00:00:57.410 --> 00:00:59.100
Just who am I?

00:00:59.570 --> 00:01:04.990
Can I still have fun when I grow up?

00:01:04.990 --> 00:01:09.700
I don't know, but I just wanna know!

00:01:09.700 --> 00:01:15.060
If we can still laugh over the small matters

00:01:15.060 --> 00:01:19.660
I'm happy enough with that!

00:01:19.690 --> 00:01:22.340
This! That! And everything else!

00:01:22.480 --> 00:01:27.200
Let the three of us play 'til we drop!

00:01:30.020 --> 00:01:35.030
We're Gonna Be *******

00:01:35.770 --> 00:01:38.710
Hey sis! Let's go play hide-and-seek!

00:01:38.710 --> 00:01:42.790
Today's coordinated study comprises of free recess activities with the first graders.

00:01:44.910 --> 00:01:46.790
It's just going to get faster, you know!

00:01:46.790 --> 00:01:48.450
Here we go!

00:01:48.450 --> 00:01:50.250
Don't get them injured!

00:01:54.710 --> 00:01:56.220
Hold on a sec.

00:01:56.220 --> 00:01:59.720
Because you're around, none of the kids are coming to me!

00:01:59.720 --> 00:02:01.600
Well then, why don't you go somewhere else?

00:02:03.100 --> 00:02:04.840
How shameful.

00:02:04.840 --> 00:02:06.960
Blaming your lack of popularity on others.

00:02:07.480 --> 00:02:09.450
Children are honest after all.

00:02:09.450 --> 00:02:12.270
They can differentiate between the good and the bad.

00:02:12.270 --> 00:02:15.290
Hey, how do you do this?

00:02:15.290 --> 00:02:16.720
It's so fun!

00:02:16.720 --> 00:02:18.760
Erm, could you stop touching them like that?

00:02:18.760 --> 00:02:20.950
Goes to show that children just like weird things, huh?

00:02:20.950 --> 00:02:22.950
S-Shut up!

00:02:22.950 --> 00:02:24.240
Let's get moving.

00:02:24.240 --> 00:02:25.470
Hmph.

00:02:25.470 --> 00:02:27.630
Kids are nothing more than annoyances, really.

00:02:29.370 --> 00:02:30.820
Hey, wait up.

00:02:30.820 --> 00:02:32.380
It's forbidden to cause destruction to nature like that.

00:02:32.380 --> 00:02:33.380
Huh?

00:02:33.860 --> 00:02:36.250
But if you did that to relieve stress, that's fine.

00:02:36.250 --> 00:02:37.380
You shouldn't be allowing that at all...

00:02:37.860 --> 00:02:40.340
The radio-controlled copter got caught over there.

00:02:40.340 --> 00:02:41.410
Radio-controlled copter?

00:02:41.410 --> 00:02:43.220
Look, over there!

00:02:43.220 --> 00:02:46.060
I had my mama buy it for me just the other day, too.

00:02:46.710 --> 00:02:49.150
Why did you bring it over to school in the first place?

00:02:49.150 --> 00:02:51.120
Because I don't have any friends.

00:02:51.120 --> 00:02:52.440
T-That so?

00:02:53.640 --> 00:02:55.240
Well, I suppose it can't be helped!

00:02:55.240 --> 00:02:57.240
I'll go get it for you, then!

00:02:57.240 --> 00:02:59.610
In exchange for that, add on sama-honorific when you address me,

00:02:59.610 --> 00:03:00.700
as well as use keigo when speaking to me.

00:03:00.700 --> 00:03:02.240
Then, for an entire day, be my footstool-

00:03:02.240 --> 00:03:03.160
Stop the blabbering!

00:03:03.160 --> 00:03:03.910
Hurry and take it for me!

00:03:06.110 --> 00:03:07.800
Such a cheeky kiddo.

00:03:07.800 --> 00:03:09.670
I bet he hasn't received much of a proper upbringing!

00:03:10.290 --> 00:03:11.220
Gosh.

00:03:11.220 --> 00:03:13.340
Could you just get it already?

00:03:17.760 --> 00:03:18.830
Hm?

00:03:18.830 --> 00:03:19.760
What's with you?

00:03:26.180 --> 00:03:27.260
Whoa!

00:03:27.260 --> 00:03:29.080
It's of a different colour!

00:03:29.080 --> 00:03:30.490
Do you know of the Gachi Rangers, then?!

00:03:30.490 --> 00:03:31.020
Yup.

00:03:32.540 --> 00:03:34.390
Alright! I've got it now.

00:03:34.390 --> 00:03:36.480
I'll throw it over to you, so please catch it-!

00:03:36.480 --> 00:03:37.760
Wow...

00:03:37.760 --> 00:03:39.190
That's a really nice colour.

00:03:39.190 --> 00:03:41.410
Wait-What are you guys doing?!

00:03:41.410 --> 00:03:42.760
Moreover...

00:03:44.160 --> 00:03:45.560
Whoa...!

00:03:45.560 --> 00:03:47.410
It's the Deluxe Gachi-Belt!

00:03:47.410 --> 00:03:48.680
That's so cool!

00:03:48.680 --> 00:03:51.340
Damn, they had something like this, too?!

00:03:51.340 --> 00:03:52.670
Hey, wait there!

00:03:52.670 --> 00:03:54.960
It's alright if you touch it.

00:03:54.960 --> 00:03:56.090
Stop!

00:03:56.090 --> 00:03:57.420
Stop!!!

00:03:57.880 --> 00:03:59.670
Hold it right there, you!

00:03:59.670 --> 00:04:00.770
The heck's your problem?

00:04:00.770 --> 00:04:01.590
You're so noisy.

00:04:01.590 --> 00:04:03.850
I can't get down with just one arm,

00:04:03.850 --> 00:04:05.600
so if you don't come and catch it, I'll just drop it over here!

00:04:05.600 --> 00:04:07.230
Whatever, it doesn't matter anymore.

00:04:08.040 --> 00:04:09.820
If it breaks, I can have her buy me another.

00:04:13.120 --> 00:04:14.090
Eh? Wait!

00:04:14.090 --> 00:04:15.480
Come on, show me more!

00:04:16.440 --> 00:04:19.150
I dislike people who do not cherish their belongings.

00:04:19.150 --> 00:04:20.500
Why's that?!

00:04:20.500 --> 00:04:22.610
My mama buys me whatever I want, you know.

00:04:25.470 --> 00:04:29.140
Yet, you may never know if she will...

00:04:29.950 --> 00:04:31.410
buy you anything ever again.

00:04:31.410 --> 00:04:32.390
What...?

00:04:39.430 --> 00:04:40.790
That was a close call.

00:04:41.530 --> 00:04:43.750
From now on, make sure you treasure what you receive, okay?

00:04:43.750 --> 00:04:44.980
Y-Yeah, sure-!

00:04:44.980 --> 00:04:46.760
Why don't you show any concern towards me?!

00:04:46.760 --> 00:04:47.920
Also,

00:04:47.920 --> 00:04:51.030
how did you tame this conceited little brat anyway?!

00:04:51.030 --> 00:04:52.400
You damn pervert!

00:04:52.400 --> 00:04:54.220
I can't tell you about that.

00:04:54.220 --> 00:04:54.980
Eh, pervert?

00:04:54.980 --> 00:04:58.860
Rather than this stumpy lil' girl, I'm the more charming one, right?!

00:04:58.860 --> 00:04:59.860
Huh?

00:04:59.860 --> 00:05:02.220
L-Look here.

00:05:02.220 --> 00:05:04.200
My side of this is better, no?

00:05:04.200 --> 00:05:05.640
See here.

00:05:05.640 --> 00:05:07.640
Wait... Micchan?!

00:05:07.640 --> 00:05:08.990
See! Look here!

00:05:09.460 --> 00:05:11.000
Ryuuta!

00:05:11.000 --> 00:05:12.160
Sister!

00:05:12.160 --> 00:05:12.770
Er?

00:05:15.170 --> 00:05:16.400
Big Sister,

00:05:16.400 --> 00:05:18.750
that person's making me see her panties.

00:05:20.920 --> 00:05:22.880
Erm, this is...

00:05:25.640 --> 00:05:27.720
Don't you ever come near my lil' brother ever again!

00:05:27.720 --> 00:05:29.740
You damn pervert of a girl!

00:05:33.730 --> 00:05:35.860
We are leaving now, Ryuuta!

00:05:35.860 --> 00:05:39.740
You know, she was wearing the same panties as Megu from my class.

00:05:43.530 --> 00:05:45.490
Several Days Later

00:05:55.180 --> 00:05:55.830
Ah!

00:05:55.830 --> 00:05:56.540
I-It's you?!

00:05:57.060 --> 00:05:58.380
What did you come here for?

00:05:58.380 --> 00:06:02.590
Since Sugisaki was absent I came over to deliver her class print-outs to you.

00:06:03.660 --> 00:06:04.790
I don't need them!

00:06:04.790 --> 00:06:05.590
Go back!

00:06:07.060 --> 00:06:07.990
They're not for you!

00:06:07.990 --> 00:06:10.120
I'm telling you that you should bring them to your older sister!

00:06:10.120 --> 00:06:11.350
For crying out loud.

00:06:11.350 --> 00:06:13.880
This is why I just hate kids!

00:06:15.050 --> 00:06:17.100
Hey, hey, who's she?

00:06:17.100 --> 00:06:18.750
She's someone from my older sister's class.

00:06:20.520 --> 00:06:23.780
Listen well, don't go anywhere near her, alright?!

00:06:23.780 --> 00:06:25.960
That's because she's a nympho.

00:06:27.270 --> 00:06:29.150
Well, that's what my older sis told me, at least.

00:06:30.320 --> 00:06:33.580
That damn girl...!

00:06:34.090 --> 00:06:35.500
What's this "Nympho?"

00:06:35.500 --> 00:06:36.750
I don't know.

00:06:36.750 --> 00:06:37.790
Me neither.

00:06:39.330 --> 00:06:41.500
Oi, what's this "nympho" anyway?!

00:06:41.500 --> 00:06:44.240
Y-You're going to ask me?!

00:06:44.240 --> 00:06:46.770
That is something you learn only when you're older-

00:06:47.990 --> 00:06:50.760
Alright, I've got it. I'll tell you.

00:06:51.270 --> 00:06:53.310
This so-called "nympho" refers to...

00:06:53.310 --> 00:06:56.070
someone who's graceful and refined.

00:06:56.070 --> 00:06:57.480
Someone like myself, you see.

00:06:57.480 --> 00:06:59.840
Isn't that for real? That's awesome, right?!

00:06:59.840 --> 00:07:01.710
I-Indeed.

00:07:01.710 --> 00:07:03.530
Would you exceed that of the Prime Minister, too?

00:07:03.530 --> 00:07:04.230
Aha, yes...

00:07:04.230 --> 00:07:06.130
That's so cool!

00:07:06.130 --> 00:07:08.810
And I was sure it was some sort of slander.

00:07:08.810 --> 00:07:09.660
Hah.

00:07:09.660 --> 00:07:11.740
Children can be so stupid.

00:07:11.740 --> 00:07:13.530
The Following Morning

00:07:20.610 --> 00:07:22.330
It's Miss Nympho!

00:07:22.330 --> 00:07:24.280
Hi, Miss Nympho!

00:07:24.960 --> 00:07:27.550
P-Please don't go saying that so loud!

00:07:27.550 --> 00:07:30.150
You know, this so-called nympho actually is-

00:07:30.150 --> 00:07:32.410
You really are a pretty lady, aren't you?

00:07:32.410 --> 00:07:33.260
Eh?

00:07:33.260 --> 00:07:34.510
P-Pretty lady...?

00:07:34.510 --> 00:07:37.530
You're fashionable and stylish, just like a model!

00:07:37.530 --> 00:07:39.480
That must definitely be since you're a nympho, huh?

00:07:39.480 --> 00:07:42.650
D-Do keep on saying more!

00:07:42.650 --> 00:07:43.820
Nympho!

00:07:43.820 --> 00:07:44.780
Nympho!

00:07:44.780 --> 00:07:45.900
Not that one word!

00:07:46.270 --> 00:07:48.180
My pretty lady!

00:07:48.180 --> 00:07:50.100
My fashionable lady!

00:07:51.470 --> 00:07:53.450
I just love kids now...!

00:07:53.450 --> 00:07:55.470
I want to become a nympho!

00:07:55.470 --> 00:07:56.580
Me, too!

00:07:56.580 --> 00:07:59.410
Wait, I told you you're saying this too loud!

00:07:59.880 --> 00:08:00.970
Listen up,

00:08:00.970 --> 00:08:04.160
it's a national secret that I'm a nympho, you know.

00:08:04.160 --> 00:08:05.640
You mustn't tell anyone!

00:08:06.380 --> 00:08:07.090
Okay...

00:08:07.450 --> 00:08:10.140
Hey there, Futaba, Eldest Daughter!

00:08:10.140 --> 00:08:12.490
She's not "Eldest Daughter," she's a nympho!

00:08:12.490 --> 00:08:14.090
Didn't you register a word I just said?!

00:08:14.090 --> 00:08:16.190
Futaba's the second daughter.

00:08:14.090 --> 00:08:16.190
TL Note: Chijyo (nympho) sounds similar to Jijyou (second daughter)

00:08:16.190 --> 00:08:17.970
This one's Eldest Daughter.

00:08:17.970 --> 00:08:19.230
Safe...!

00:08:19.230 --> 00:08:23.960
Hey, what must we do to become a nympho like yourself?

00:08:23.960 --> 00:08:24.990
Eh?

00:08:24.990 --> 00:08:26.190
Well, about that...

00:08:26.190 --> 00:08:28.390
Tell us, tell us please!

00:08:29.190 --> 00:08:31.610
Make sure you keep yourself well-groomed,

00:08:31.610 --> 00:08:33.660
and proudly maintain your self-confidence.

00:08:33.660 --> 00:08:35.900
Don't bow your head to anyone.

00:08:35.900 --> 00:08:36.620
Then, you should-

00:08:36.620 --> 00:08:37.180
Ah!

00:08:37.180 --> 00:08:39.450
Sugisaki, good morning!

00:08:39.450 --> 00:08:41.590
Wait, listen to me already!

00:08:41.590 --> 00:08:44.430
Your older sister is also quite a pretty lady, huh?

00:08:44.430 --> 00:08:47.090
She's stylish, just like a model!

00:08:47.090 --> 00:08:47.730
Eh?!

00:08:47.730 --> 00:08:49.340
Y-You don't say...

00:08:49.340 --> 00:08:51.560
As I thought, you must also be a nympho, right?

00:08:52.550 --> 00:08:53.710
Well...

00:08:53.710 --> 00:08:55.940
She is kind of like a nympho, I guess.

00:08:55.940 --> 00:08:58.080
What are you saying?!

00:08:58.080 --> 00:08:59.580
What's the deal?!

00:08:59.580 --> 00:09:00.930
I'm praising you, aren't I?!

00:09:00.930 --> 00:09:03.410
Just as I thought, she is a nympho!

00:09:03.410 --> 00:09:07.250
Eh, you two there, where did you learn such a word from?!

00:09:07.250 --> 00:09:08.070
Ah.

00:09:09.310 --> 00:09:12.630
What do you intend to do by indoctrinating the children with these words?

00:09:12.630 --> 00:09:14.360
Er, I...

00:09:15.280 --> 00:09:16.100
Hah?!

00:09:16.100 --> 00:09:17.480
What the heck is with that?!

00:09:17.480 --> 00:09:19.010
I just couldn't help it!

00:09:19.010 --> 00:09:20.200
From the very start, it was you that-

00:09:20.200 --> 00:09:21.820
You really are a fool.

00:09:21.820 --> 00:09:24.450
At this rate, it's gonna be nothing but bad news if you keep it up.

00:09:24.450 --> 00:09:26.240
"Bad news," you say?

00:09:26.240 --> 00:09:27.520
Do you really know anything?

00:09:27.520 --> 00:09:30.620
There are a lot of weirdos out there nowadays, you know.

00:09:30.620 --> 00:09:31.350
Wha-

00:09:31.350 --> 00:09:36.010
Try saying: "I want to be a nympho" to those folks,

00:09:36.010 --> 00:09:37.280
what do you think will happen?

00:09:38.040 --> 00:09:40.560
Nymphos!

00:09:40.560 --> 00:09:43.610
We're gonna be nymphos~!

00:09:44.650 --> 00:09:46.730
Well, I know nothing about this.

00:09:46.730 --> 00:09:49.140
Make sure you take the responsibility and fix this up!

00:09:50.410 --> 00:09:51.440
Hey,

00:09:52.500 --> 00:09:56.360
I've always wanted to have an older sister like you.

00:09:56.360 --> 00:10:00.620
I want to quickly become a nympho and then-

00:10:00.620 --> 00:10:01.680
It's impossible for you.

00:10:01.680 --> 00:10:02.200
What?

00:10:02.690 --> 00:10:04.240
I'm telling you that it's impossible for you!

00:10:05.570 --> 00:10:06.930
In order to become a nympho, you must

00:10:06.930 --> 00:10:11.220
be born with talent and skill and hone them from early on!

00:10:11.220 --> 00:10:14.050
Even if hundreds of years pass, you two probably wouldn't be able to make it!

00:10:14.050 --> 00:10:15.970
That's why you should give it up now!

00:10:15.970 --> 00:10:17.170
Eh...?

00:10:17.170 --> 00:10:18.390
But...

00:10:18.390 --> 00:10:20.570
Don't ever utter nympho with your mouths again!

00:10:20.570 --> 00:10:21.390
Alright!

00:10:22.070 --> 00:10:24.830
Furthermore, don't ever come near me again.

00:10:24.830 --> 00:10:25.870
Do you understand?

00:10:26.720 --> 00:10:28.270
Y-Yes...

00:10:33.600 --> 00:10:36.450
Aw, don't cry.

00:10:36.450 --> 00:10:38.130
You shouldn't cry.

00:10:39.170 --> 00:10:40.160
This way...

00:10:40.830 --> 00:10:42.240
It'll be better this way.

00:10:43.000 --> 00:10:45.810
Come now, you shouldn't cry.

00:10:45.810 --> 00:10:47.540
Don't cry.

00:10:54.730 --> 00:10:56.670
Micchan, you were so cool!

00:10:56.670 --> 00:10:57.670
Huh?

00:10:57.670 --> 00:11:00.240
You demonstrated kindness back then, right?!

00:11:00.240 --> 00:11:02.370
For the sake of not letting them suffer by becoming nymphos,

00:11:02.370 --> 00:11:03.680
you reprimanded them!

00:11:04.170 --> 00:11:05.030
What?

00:11:05.030 --> 00:11:08.290
I want to become just like Micchan and become a nympho!

00:11:08.290 --> 00:11:08.980
Huh?

00:11:09.700 --> 00:11:10.440
What did I hear?

00:11:10.850 --> 00:11:13.130
Nympho! Nympho!

00:11:13.130 --> 00:11:14.970
Hey, Futaba-!

00:11:14.970 --> 00:11:16.170
Damn it!

00:11:16.170 --> 00:11:18.450
Come to think of it, she was behind them the entire time, huh?!

00:11:18.450 --> 00:11:22.160
I want to become a refined nympho like yourself, you know!

00:11:22.160 --> 00:11:24.090
Alright! I grant you permission!

00:11:24.090 --> 00:11:26.190
Ah, yay!

00:11:26.190 --> 00:11:28.160
Hey there, refined nympho!

00:11:29.180 --> 00:11:30.910
Stop saying nympho already!

00:11:47.310 --> 00:11:48.680
Sheesh.

00:11:48.680 --> 00:11:50.770
Even though it's Saturday, you've overslept way too much.

00:11:55.400 --> 00:11:55.980
Ah, hey.

00:11:55.980 --> 00:11:57.770
That's Hitoha's drawer over there!

00:11:57.770 --> 00:11:58.690
Huh?

00:11:59.860 --> 00:12:01.360
This would be...?!

00:12:01.780 --> 00:12:02.700
Squadron of sincerity!

00:12:04.570 --> 00:12:06.030
Gachi Rangers!

00:12:06.030 --> 00:12:08.120
That's just as I thought!

00:12:08.120 --> 00:12:10.540
What's with this really lame belt?

00:12:10.540 --> 00:12:12.500
That would be the Gachi-

00:12:13.370 --> 00:12:17.590
Don't you go telling anyone that I like Gachi Rangers, okay...?

00:12:17.590 --> 00:12:19.960
Even to Papa and Micchan.

00:12:20.670 --> 00:12:22.220
What's the matter now?

00:12:22.220 --> 00:12:24.720
What were you saying this belt was?

00:12:25.220 --> 00:12:27.350
I wonder...

00:12:28.390 --> 00:12:30.770
I do have a slight recollection of where this belt is from...

00:12:34.190 --> 00:12:35.230
Just as I thought!

00:12:35.230 --> 00:12:38.020
Vibration Belt

00:12:35.230 --> 00:12:38.020
Fat
Burning
By
Vibration!

00:12:35.230 --> 00:12:38.020
10 minutes per day!

00:12:35.230 --> 00:12:38.020
After just putting it on,
you'll shape up!!

00:12:36.520 --> 00:12:38.150
The shape and design resemble each other!

00:12:38.900 --> 00:12:40.400
A fat-reducing vibe belt?

00:12:40.980 --> 00:12:43.650
Was Hitoha on a diet as well?

00:12:43.650 --> 00:12:44.150
Ah?

00:12:46.740 --> 00:12:48.370
It's a Gachi Rangers tank-top!

00:12:48.370 --> 00:12:50.410
Let me just try it on for a bit...!

00:12:57.670 --> 00:12:59.590
Are you awake yet, Futaba?

00:13:00.630 --> 00:13:02.880
I was told to tell you to hurry and eat breakfast-

00:13:03.380 --> 00:13:04.340
What are you guys doing?

00:13:05.930 --> 00:13:08.100
What could we have been thinking, indeed?!

00:13:08.100 --> 00:13:10.220
Come along, Futaba!

00:13:10.220 --> 00:13:13.060
Go wash your face and brush your teeth!

00:13:15.060 --> 00:13:17.310
Why is it nowhere to be found?!

00:13:17.310 --> 00:13:21.820
And I've checked every single electronics shop and pharmacy!

00:13:22.940 --> 00:13:26.990
Well, even if I were to find it, I definitely don't have the money to buy it...

00:13:26.990 --> 00:13:28.280
Me neither.

00:13:28.280 --> 00:13:30.120
All I have in my savings is 200 yen.

00:13:30.120 --> 00:13:33.450
Gachis are coming you're way; so, you better run!

00:13:33.450 --> 00:13:38.790
Making a stand for the sake of protecting our stars and planets!

00:13:38.790 --> 00:13:39.960
There it is!

00:13:39.960 --> 00:13:41.840
Ryuuta?!

00:13:41.840 --> 00:13:44.720
For crying out loud, there he goes running off on his own again.

00:13:46.380 --> 00:13:48.340
N-No, stop this!

00:13:48.340 --> 00:13:51.220
The money, we'll pay the money later, so, please!

00:13:55.310 --> 00:13:58.020
Getting treated as a perv again...

00:13:58.020 --> 00:14:00.440
It's all Hitoha's fault!

00:14:00.440 --> 00:14:02.320
I'm really sorry for making a rip in your tank-top!

00:14:03.900 --> 00:14:05.990
Although this may not suffice as a proper replacement...

00:14:05.990 --> 00:14:08.360
This is my own hand-drawing of them!

00:14:08.360 --> 00:14:09.490
It's really a rough sketch!

00:14:11.490 --> 00:14:12.910
It's all my fault!

00:14:13.740 --> 00:14:14.660
I will forgive you.

00:14:14.660 --> 00:14:15.910
Really?!

00:14:15.910 --> 00:14:18.000
That's because this one here is looks even cooler!

00:14:18.000 --> 00:14:20.830
I'm so glad that you've taken a liking to it!

00:14:23.380 --> 00:14:24.460
Hold it!

00:14:24.460 --> 00:14:26.260
What are you doing by apologizing to her by yourself?!

00:14:26.260 --> 00:14:27.630
You damn traitor!

00:14:27.630 --> 00:14:30.640
Micchan, you should just honestly apologize to her as well!

00:14:30.640 --> 00:14:32.930
"Honestly"...?

00:14:32.930 --> 00:14:35.930
To think that you can't even fit into a diet belt,

00:14:35.930 --> 00:14:37.430
just what kind of female animal are you, anyway?

00:14:37.430 --> 00:14:38.640
Never, it's impossible!

00:14:38.640 --> 00:14:39.770
I just can't do that!

00:14:40.480 --> 00:14:41.770
I'm home!

00:14:42.310 --> 00:14:43.190
Papa!

00:14:43.190 --> 00:14:45.110
Dinner will be ready any minute now!

00:14:45.110 --> 00:14:47.490
Hey Papa, do you want to drink some beer?

00:14:47.490 --> 00:14:49.200
Nope, I think I'm going to quit.

00:14:49.200 --> 00:14:51.370
I'm trying to watch my metabolics, you see.

00:14:52.780 --> 00:14:54.990
I will gladly receive this feast.

00:14:54.990 --> 00:14:55.870
Hm?

00:14:55.870 --> 00:14:57.330
Where's Mitsuba?

00:14:57.330 --> 00:14:59.160
Hitoha!

00:14:59.160 --> 00:15:02.250
I think you dropped this!

00:15:05.670 --> 00:15:07.010
It's broken!

00:15:07.010 --> 00:15:07.920
Ah!

00:15:07.920 --> 00:15:09.340
Speaking of which,

00:15:09.340 --> 00:15:13.890
didn't you say that you wanted to try dieting and so you gave this a try, Papa?

00:15:13.890 --> 00:15:14.510
Eh?!

00:15:14.510 --> 00:15:17.020
Papa wanted to...?

00:15:18.390 --> 00:15:19.810
Wouldn't that be that one thing...

00:15:19.810 --> 00:15:23.020
from the Gachi Rangers that Hitoha likes?

00:15:23.020 --> 00:15:23.690
Eh?

00:15:24.610 --> 00:15:26.070
You knew?

00:15:26.070 --> 00:15:27.230
Yup.

00:15:27.230 --> 00:15:30.200
I know everything about all of you, you know.

00:15:31.450 --> 00:15:36.950
I'm also aware that Mitsuba wants a belt that looks just like that.

00:15:39.700 --> 00:15:41.540
Come on, wait!

00:15:41.540 --> 00:15:43.250
Open up already!

00:15:43.250 --> 00:15:44.840
I'm sorry; it was my fault!

00:15:44.840 --> 00:15:48.460
I-I'm really sorry!

00:15:56.680 --> 00:15:58.010
Micchan,

00:15:58.010 --> 00:15:59.640
I've bought you some pudding.

00:16:01.690 --> 00:16:02.520
Can you eat?

00:16:03.690 --> 00:16:04.810
This isn't the right one!

00:16:04.810 --> 00:16:07.900
Didn't I tell you I wanted the one that's topped with whipped cream?!

00:16:07.900 --> 00:16:09.440
You didn't say so.

00:16:09.440 --> 00:16:10.570
I did!

00:16:10.570 --> 00:16:11.450
You didn't.

00:16:11.450 --> 00:16:12.030
I did!

00:16:12.030 --> 00:16:13.860
You didn't!

00:16:13.860 --> 00:16:14.780
For heaven's sake!

00:16:14.780 --> 00:16:17.530
You're really a useless little sister, aren't you?!

00:16:17.530 --> 00:16:19.580
What the heck is with that look?!

00:16:19.580 --> 00:16:21.160
Do you have a complaint or something?!

00:16:21.910 --> 00:16:23.540
Can you not register what this says?!

00:16:23.540 --> 00:16:25.040
It reads 39 degrees!

00:16:25.040 --> 00:16:26.790
39 degrees, you know!

00:16:26.790 --> 00:16:28.040
Hrm.

00:16:29.300 --> 00:16:31.800
Treat the ill with proper care!

00:16:31.800 --> 00:16:34.550
Making a face like you're ill even though you're still healthy!

00:16:34.550 --> 00:16:36.470
I don't understand what that means.

00:16:37.640 --> 00:16:40.060
Well, I'll still eat that later.

00:16:40.060 --> 00:16:42.020
Go and store it properly for now.

00:16:52.690 --> 00:16:53.110
Eh?!

00:16:56.360 --> 00:16:57.570
You guys?!

00:16:57.570 --> 00:16:59.080
Pardon the intrusion.

00:17:00.040 --> 00:17:01.500
What did you come here for?!

00:17:01.500 --> 00:17:02.870
To check and see how you were-

00:17:02.870 --> 00:17:04.120
That's wrong!

00:17:04.790 --> 00:17:07.750
We've come to observe your weakened state.

00:17:08.210 --> 00:17:10.090
I've made some tea, so...

00:17:10.090 --> 00:17:11.840
Ah, thank you.

00:17:11.840 --> 00:17:13.970
Is there any poison? Did you add some poison to it?!

00:17:13.970 --> 00:17:15.590
Don't say that boldly!

00:17:15.590 --> 00:17:17.260
You sure are active, huh?

00:17:18.510 --> 00:17:22.390
Rather than running a cold, you seem to be twice as annoying than usual.

00:17:22.390 --> 00:17:23.850
I wonder what's making that happen.

00:17:23.850 --> 00:17:24.480
Well then,

00:17:24.480 --> 00:17:26.520
why don't you just leave right now?!

00:17:26.520 --> 00:17:28.980
I will only after I've seen the weakened you.

00:17:30.440 --> 00:17:31.070
Well then.

00:17:31.070 --> 00:17:33.440
You're annoying so don't climb up here!

00:17:33.440 --> 00:17:35.030
As I thought, she really is energetic.

00:17:35.030 --> 00:17:35.950
Ah.

00:17:35.950 --> 00:17:38.780
Come to think of it, we've changed our seating arrangements for class today.

00:17:38.780 --> 00:17:39.820
Eh?

00:17:39.820 --> 00:17:40.830
Change of seating arrangements?

00:17:40.830 --> 00:17:43.080
It was all my own suggestion, you see.

00:17:43.080 --> 00:17:46.040
<i>"Why don't we decide on this while the whiney brat isn't around!"</i>

00:17:46.040 --> 00:17:46.960
Just die!

00:17:48.080 --> 00:17:49.250
What are you doing?!

00:17:50.420 --> 00:17:52.840
If it's that vexing, why don't you climb up here and have a go at me?!

00:17:52.840 --> 00:17:54.050
You idiot!

00:17:54.050 --> 00:17:56.130
What did you say?!

00:17:56.130 --> 00:17:57.760
Those two are really childish, huh?

00:17:57.760 --> 00:18:00.510
Now, now. Please don't fight like this, you two!

00:18:00.510 --> 00:18:03.850
Sugi bought you some pudding, you know!

00:18:03.850 --> 00:18:06.100
No-That's not it!

00:18:06.100 --> 00:18:07.020
Th-This isn't for...

00:18:07.020 --> 00:18:10.440
That's why you should cheer up and eat it with us!

00:18:10.440 --> 00:18:12.020
What are you saying now?!

00:18:12.020 --> 00:18:15.360
I said that I would eat that in front of Mitsuba!

00:18:15.360 --> 00:18:17.450
Come now, Micchan!

00:18:19.950 --> 00:18:21.030
What's wrong?

00:18:23.080 --> 00:18:23.910
Ah!

00:18:26.040 --> 00:18:26.910
This isn't looking good!

00:18:26.910 --> 00:18:28.670
It looks like her condition is worsening.

00:18:28.670 --> 00:18:29.460
Eh?!

00:18:29.460 --> 00:18:31.960
Could that mean it's all our fault?!

00:18:32.500 --> 00:18:33.880
She reaps what she sowed!

00:18:33.880 --> 00:18:35.670
At any rate, we should do something about this.

00:18:35.670 --> 00:18:37.420
If medicine will do, there's some.

00:18:37.420 --> 00:18:38.380
Wha-?!

00:18:38.380 --> 00:18:39.680
You were there all along, Third Daughter?

00:18:39.680 --> 00:18:41.850
If you've got medicine, then let's let her have some!

00:18:42.260 --> 00:18:44.680
It would be a medicine that has an immediate effect, though.

00:18:44.680 --> 00:18:45.850
Instant effect, you say?

00:18:45.850 --> 00:18:48.810
It'll work on the spot, right? That will do, then!

00:18:48.810 --> 00:18:50.230
It's a suppository.

00:18:51.190 --> 00:18:52.730
S-Suppository...?

00:18:52.730 --> 00:18:54.860
T-That's the one you put in your butt?

00:18:54.860 --> 00:18:57.320
No, this is not a time for backing down.

00:18:57.320 --> 00:18:58.860
We are all girls, too!

00:18:58.860 --> 00:19:01.030
Th-That's right!

00:19:01.030 --> 00:19:03.160
Otherwise, Micchan may die, right?!

00:19:03.160 --> 00:19:04.830
She can die for all I care.

00:19:06.410 --> 00:19:10.040
Problem is, if we don't have the ladder, we can't climb up.

00:19:10.750 --> 00:19:12.880
Micchan raised it up there earlier.

00:19:12.880 --> 00:19:16.630
Alright, Third Daughter, you can ride my shoulders.

00:19:18.090 --> 00:19:20.510
Come here! Hurry!

00:19:22.840 --> 00:19:24.180
Here we go!

00:19:24.180 --> 00:19:26.060
Ready, set!

00:19:29.180 --> 00:19:30.560
I will get it!

00:19:31.310 --> 00:19:33.690
Medicine, medicine...

00:19:33.690 --> 00:19:34.520
Huh?

00:19:37.480 --> 00:19:39.650
It's a porno book!

00:19:39.650 --> 00:19:40.200
Eh?!

00:19:40.200 --> 00:19:41.740
Wouldn't that be Futaba's?

00:19:41.740 --> 00:19:43.110
That's mine.

00:19:43.110 --> 00:19:44.530
What?!

00:19:44.530 --> 00:19:46.580
Sugi, go get it for me!

00:19:46.580 --> 00:19:48.040
I-I don't want to!

00:19:48.040 --> 00:19:50.160
Mitsuba can really die for all I care.

00:19:50.160 --> 00:19:51.540
I will get it, so wait.

00:19:53.880 --> 00:19:55.960
Just how many of them do you have?!

00:19:57.710 --> 00:19:59.760
It's no good. I can't reach it.

00:19:59.760 --> 00:20:00.720
Eh?!

00:20:01.420 --> 00:20:03.300
We need to lift the bed slightly.

00:20:03.300 --> 00:20:05.220
Do you really have no other kind of medicine?

00:20:05.640 --> 00:20:07.640
There's nothing but that.

00:20:07.640 --> 00:20:09.850
It'll be tough to lift the bed, you know.

00:20:09.850 --> 00:20:11.890
Sugisaki, come help us already!

00:20:11.890 --> 00:20:12.690
Hmph.

00:20:12.690 --> 00:20:14.400
Anyway, let's try this!

00:20:15.270 --> 00:20:16.400
Alright!

00:20:16.400 --> 00:20:18.110
Ready, set...!

00:20:19.320 --> 00:20:21.490
It won't even budge a bit!

00:20:21.490 --> 00:20:23.280
That's because Micchan's up there...!

00:20:24.530 --> 00:20:27.870
Hey, help us, Sugisaki!

00:20:27.870 --> 00:20:28.580
Hmph!

00:20:28.580 --> 00:20:29.910
Sugisaki!

00:20:29.910 --> 00:20:31.250
Ready, set...!

00:20:34.460 --> 00:20:35.540
Ready, set...!

00:20:37.710 --> 00:20:38.710
It's no use!

00:20:38.710 --> 00:20:40.550
It won't move at all!

00:20:42.300 --> 00:20:44.180
Ready, set...!

00:20:45.050 --> 00:20:46.300
Sugi...

00:20:47.930 --> 00:20:49.060
Ready, set...!

00:20:50.560 --> 00:20:51.730
It's lifted up!

00:20:52.100 --> 00:20:53.270
Sugi!

00:20:53.270 --> 00:20:54.520
What are you guys doing?!

00:20:54.520 --> 00:20:55.690
Here we go, okay?!

00:21:03.610 --> 00:21:04.450
I was able to get it!

00:21:05.320 --> 00:21:06.490
Good going!

00:21:13.960 --> 00:21:16.210
Her fever has gone down.

00:21:16.210 --> 00:21:17.750
That's great.

00:21:17.750 --> 00:21:19.000
Really now,

00:21:19.000 --> 00:21:20.710
she does cause a ruckus for others.

00:21:20.710 --> 00:21:23.590
You're surprisingly stronger than you look, Sugisaki!

00:21:23.590 --> 00:21:25.010
Sh-Shut it!

00:21:27.800 --> 00:21:29.220
I'm home!

00:21:29.800 --> 00:21:30.720
Welcome home.

00:21:30.720 --> 00:21:33.220
I do have a bit of question but,

00:21:33.220 --> 00:21:35.230
would you happen to know where my hemorrhoid medicine might be?

00:21:37.850 --> 00:21:38.610
Sorry to bother.

00:21:38.610 --> 00:21:40.190
I suppose you folks don't know.

00:21:40.190 --> 00:21:43.530
Yet, you know, I didn't have anything but one left.

00:21:44.490 --> 00:21:45.860
Phew.

00:21:45.860 --> 00:21:48.990
It's so comfortable at my butt; it feels nice.

00:21:49.530 --> 00:21:53.080
The following day, Micchan's cold was completely cured.

00:21:53.080 --> 00:21:55.000
And so, we lived happily ever after.

00:22:16.950 --> 00:22:22.040
As the sun sets on the schoolyard

00:22:22.180 --> 00:22:27.310
I waved my hand, and head back home

00:22:27.520 --> 00:22:32.490
Tonight, when I go to bed

00:22:32.660 --> 00:22:37.790
It'd be great if I can see you again

00:22:38.070 --> 00:22:43.340
Let's go to sleep

00:22:43.340 --> 00:22:47.290
I can't wait for tomorrow

00:22:49.480 --> 00:22:54.380
It's really wonderful in my dream, you see...

00:22:54.750 --> 00:22:59.280
You can even fly into the sky

00:22:59.990 --> 00:23:13.830
My heart aches when I hold your hand, even in my dream

00:23:13.950 --> 00:23:19.290
Just like my dream-colored love

00:23:25.770 --> 00:23:28.120
What should I do?!

00:23:28.120 --> 00:23:30.290
Sugi, are you having some sort of trouble?

00:23:30.290 --> 00:23:32.900
I must never let Mitsuba know about this!

00:23:32.900 --> 00:23:35.630
If Mitsuba finds out, then it'll all be over!

00:23:34.470 --> 00:23:40.010
Things Get WEIRD in 5 Seconds

00:23:37.110 --> 00:23:39.420
Sugi is broken!

00:23:44.230 --> 00:23:49.780
Before 5 Seconds Are Up, Things Get Seriously Strange
